5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m a bit nervous about this. The old split feels unfair now that we’re five. What are we thinking?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to see the actual numbers before we decide. I need to know what the bills really cost across a full year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
