8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The current split is outdated. We need to verify if the workload is actually uneven before we start guessing.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shunichi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi: The current split is outdated. We need to verify if the workload is actually uneven before we start guessing.""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’ve noticed the tension around these bills. I want to address how the money talks are affecting our relationships before we pick a system.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
