36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The variance is extreme. February hit 29,400 yen, August dropped to 9,100. No two months are close. Metering costs 34,000 yen per room.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, forty minutes a month is actually manageable! But the template meant keying in every single invoice. That’s a lot of typing for one person.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the variance confirms the problem. The monitor shows one room draws four times another, yet the split is identical. The rooms were assigned by lot, not need.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the payment log shows three late settlements, all after someone questioned a sudden change. The cooler notice stayed up all summer; people sweated rather than argue.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, that winter variance is terrifying. But @Shunichi, seeing people just leave heaters on without worrying is actually really appealing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, that comfort comes from a fixed rate, not metering. Metering costs 170,000 yen upfront. I need to know if the seasonal variance justifies that expense.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, forty minutes is fine, but the template meant typing every invoice! That’s hours of boring work. I don’t want to be the one stuck doing that forever.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the template is a symptom of bad design, not the solution. The data proves the current split is mathematically wrong. We need a system that reflects actual usage, not just who types faster.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
